   "text": "Compliance Requirements in EU Investment Services Regulation presents the following source proposition: It begins by revisiting the particular compliance requirements in the MiFID II directive, and how those requirements have been given shape by means of a delegated regulation and ESMA guidelines. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Almost 300 deferred prosecution agreements have been executed since 2003, whereas before 2003 they were rarely used. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
