   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7868",
   "text": "&amp;nbsp;Prompt Accountability and Session-Context Disclosure presents the following source proposition: The everyday person is not the limitation of this research-they are the only valid instrument for it. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Recording all transactions in the public blockchain is what lets LendingRobot comply with its best execution obligations, making the public ledger a compliance instrument and not only an investment record. The proposed response is a qualification: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
