   "text": "The Democratic Challenges in Global Governance of AI presents the following source proposition: Artificial intelligence is bound to have a significant impact on societies and global politics. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Web3 systems offer significant improvements over conventional regulatory approaches to the challenges of governing AI in legal settings. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
