  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-7563",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7563",
   "text": "A proposal to improve research in AI algorithm and data governance presents the following source proposition: Complementarily these studies will be made available for discussions in a Decentralized Autonomous Organization to be implemented, especially for this purpose, in the environment called web3 or Decentralized Finance (DeFi). This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Once secure and meaningful reputation is incorporated into Web3, the collateral imbalance will reverse, and because reputation tokens are more meaningful than identity and easier to value, less collateralization will be required than in traditional protocols. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
