   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7341",
   "text": "Evaluating and Defending against Adversarial Threats in Multimodal AI presents the following source proposition: Multimodal AI systems combine text, images, audio, video, and sensor data in a single pipeline. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Integrating multimodal data from legal proceedings, combining text with audio and video such as courtroom transcripts, oral arguments, and visual cues, will make predictive analytics more robust by capturing richer case dynamics. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
