   "text": "Artificial Intelligence Governance Mechanisms—The Chief Data Officer Perspective with a Focus on Agentic AI Governance presents the following source proposition: This triggers many opportunities for innovation but also increases risks. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Private fund advisers' increasing use of blockchain technology, artificial intelligence, and big data is a distinct source of downward pressure on the traditional 2/20 fee structure that commentators have not examined. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
