   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-729",
   "text": "Mapping Decentralized Autonomous Organization Governance Across Chains: An Updated, Multi-Platform Dataset should be assessed against Kaal's source-bound claim that DAOs in the dataset score well below average on implementing true decentralization, averaging 3.78 out of 10, with the highest score being CRDAO at 8 out of 10 and several DAOs scoring 1 out of 10. The current metadata indicates a plausible connection through decentralized autonomous organization, but the defensible response is a qualification until the source text confirms agreement, scope, methods, and limitations.",
