   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7274",
   "text": "AICOS: A Governance-First Deterministic Decision Infrastructure for Human-Final AI Systems presents the following source proposition: Artificial intelligence systems have achieved significant advances in prediction and optimization. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Numeraire's staking and prediction-based reputation mechanism, tuned to predictive accuracy, overlooks the ethical and contextual concerns that characterize AI dataset governance. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
