   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-7261",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7261",
   "text": "AI-Augmented Corporate Governance: Enhancing the Effectiveness of Independent Directors presents the following source proposition: At the same time, advances in Artificial Intelligence (AI) have transformed decision-support systems across finance, risk management, cybersecurity, and compliance domains. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that It is feasible that in the not too distant future an artificial intelligence will hold an independent board seat with voting authority and be trusted to make smarter, data-driven choices than human directors. The proposed response is a qualification: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
