   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-726",
   "text": "Static and dynamic regulations of photovoltaic double skin facades towards building sustainability: A review should be assessed against Kaal's source-bound claim that The speed of smart contracting and associated DAO revisions will render regulations aimed at morphing decentralized systems obsolete before static centralized regulations are even finalized. The current metadata indicates a plausible connection through dynamic regulation, but the defensible response is a qualification until the source text confirms agreement, scope, methods, and limitations.",
