   "text": "The Imperative of Robust AI Governance: Addressing Risks and Ensuring Ethical Deployment presents the following source proposition: The rapid evolution of artificial intelligence (AI) has brought unprecedented opportunities and challenges. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Decentralized data production will succeed only if it solves fraudulent submissions, content moderation, and alignment with ethical and legal frameworks; these are necessary conditions, not incidental risks. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
