  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-7187",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7187",
   "text": "The Unified AI Governance Blueprint (UAGB): A Practical Model for Responsible AI Adoption in Financial Institutions presents the following source proposition: The rapid proliferation of artificial intelligence (AI) across financial services has exposed critical gaps in governance, risk management, and regulatory compliance. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Proposed regulatory remedies such as mandatory bias audits fail in practice because they lack clear implementation guidelines, which hinders their practical adoption. The proposed response is a qualification: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
