   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7186",
   "text": "AI-Driven Transformation in Public Governance presents the following source proposition: Artificial intelligence (AI) and advanced digital technologies are transforming public governance, leading to Public Administration 5.0. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Critics who dismiss artificial intelligence on boards as science fiction not worth engaging are wrong: AI on boards is a real prospect, and technologies such as blockchain-based smart contracts will both disrupt corporate governance and supply solutions to it. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
