  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-7183",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7183",
   "text": "Synergy Between AI Adoption, Governance and Sustainable Development Goals presents the following source proposition: AI mechanisms play a crucial role in enhancing governance mechanisms by improving decision-making, transparency, efficiency and accountability across various domains, including public administration, corporate governance and regulatory oversight. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that The author endorses the conclusion that attempts to enhance oversight in the United States may fail and that emphasizing improved oversight as a means of enhancing corporate governance could be ill-advised. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
