   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7151",
   "text": "The Application of Blockchain Technology in The Promotion of Cultural and Creative Products presents the following source proposition: As the underlying technical framework of the Internet, blockchain has been applied in many fields, and \"Internet plus+cultural and creative industry\" is also increasingly valued. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Adoption of blockchain is costly and technically difficult because the technology is continually evolving and integrating blockchain databases with existing systems raises many technical challenges, such as interfacing a payment ledger with a vehicle's control software. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
