   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7147",
   "text": "Key Technologies of a Service Platform Based on Blockchain Technology presents the following source proposition: With the further improvement and application of blockchain technology, blockchain will be integrated with traditional industries such as finance, medical care, and logistics. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that As the use of blockchain technology grows in the private investment fund industry, pressure on the traditional fee structure is likely to continue to grow, even though the proportion of fund strategies applying such technologies remains small. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
