   "text": "ETHICAL AI GOVERNANCE USING BLOCKCHAIN presents the following source proposition: This research proposes a decentralized governance framework integrating blockchain technology to strengthen ethical oversight in AI systems. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Combining quantum computing with blockchain and DAO frameworks makes a governance model possible that is simultaneously transparent, decentralized, and adaptive, supporting efficient and fair resource distribution and continuous innovation. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
