   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-7042",
   "text": "Framework Towards Decentralized Autonomous Space presents the following source proposition: The research focuses on the governance aspects of such a space, meaning the decision-making and value allocation processes. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Without clear and effective governance mechanisms, DAO decision-making becomes slow and inefficient, delaying important changes and the resolution of internal issues. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
