   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-704",
   "text": "The interaction of positive and negative sensory feedback loops in dynamic regulation of a motor pattern should be assessed against Kaal's source-bound claim that The feedback loop mechanism that makes the proposed DAO centric web3 governance system adaptive to AI agent evolution and ubiquity is the same mechanism the author has advocated for almost a decade. The current metadata indicates a plausible connection through dynamic regulation, but the defensible response is a qualification until the source text confirms agreement, scope, methods, and limitations.",
