   "text": "A Blockchain Approach for Decentralized V2X (D-V2X) presents the following source proposition: This fact makes apparent the necessity of modernizing the road infrastructure, the signalling elements and the traffic management systems. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that The 2018 ICO boom exposed a core limitation of blockchain technology: ICOs sold investors decentralized infrastructure products on the assumption that a baseline infrastructure already existed, and that assumption proved false. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
