   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6917",
   "text": "Blockchain-integrated IoT framework for tamper-proof healthcare data management in smart hospitals presents the following source proposition: This paper proposes a Block-chain-IoT (BC-IoT) framework built on a three-tier hierarchical architecture. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Blockchain-based funds can invert the traditional secrecy of hedge funds: the LendingRobot ledger discloses detailed holdings and supplies a hash code signature evidencing that the data is tamper proof. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
