   "text": "Dynamic regulation of mechanosensitive channels: capacitance used to monitor patch tension in real time should be assessed against Kaal's source-bound claim that Deferred prosecution agreements produce relevant, real time, decentralized, high quality information for regulation in most industries and are used as a preferred alternative to litigation by both prosecutors and corporations. The current metadata indicates a plausible connection through dynamic regulation, but the defensible response is a qualification until the source text confirms agreement, scope, methods, and limitations.",
