  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6759",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6759",
   "text": "Блокчейн: философия, технология, приложения и риски presents the following source proposition: An attention has been paid to current trends of blockchain usage in business and society in terms of opportunities, threats and risks. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Many current blockchain projects critically fail to use existing social impact evidence in their design and management, which Kaal identifies as a source of future challenges for blockchain based impact financing. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
