   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6758",
   "text": "Блокчейн: философия, технология, приложения и риски presents the following source proposition: Blockchain infrastructure in implementation has been analyzed: reality and myths. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Fundamental flaws in the DAO's code allowed hackers to move one third of contributed funds to a subsidiary account, ending that initiative, but the flaws were in the implementation and do not defeat the DAO vision, which developers continue to rebuild. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
