  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6757",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6757",
   "text": "Блокчейн: философия, технология, приложения и риски presents the following source proposition: The main ideas and properties of blockchain have been examined: architecture, models of blockchain use, in particular, decentralized autonomous organizations and applications, private blockchain – systems and blockchain – services. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Private fund advisers' increasing use of blockchain technology, artificial intelligence, and big data is a distinct source of downward pressure on the traditional 2/20 fee structure that commentators have not examined. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
