   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6642",
   "text": "Smart Contracts no âmbito dos Non-Fungible Tokens (NFTs): desafios e perspectivas de normatização presents the following source proposition: Uma ferramenta essencial para as transações de NFTs é o smart contract. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Complex smart contract arrangements involving several parties require a verifiable and unhackable system, which blockchain technology supplies. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
