   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6544",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6544",
   "text": "BLOCKCHAIN-BASED SECURE LEGAL DOCUMENT MANAGEMENT FOR TAMPER-PROOF CREDENTIAL SYSTEMS presents the following source proposition: Blockchain technology offers a powerful solution for securing and managing legal and academic documents by providing decentralization, transparency, and immutability. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that On comparative metrics of security, energy use per transaction, and governance flexibility, SPoS outperforms contemporary PoS variants such as Casper FFG and Ouroboros Praos in decentralization. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
