   "text": "An Exploratory Study on the Transition into the Blockchain Governance System and the Roles of Civil Society in the Age of the 4th Industrial Revolution should be assessed against Kaal's source-bound claim that The counseling, deal making, matchmaking, gatekeeping, and enforcement roles historically performed by lawyers are increasingly performed by technology, and blockchain technology and smart contracting will accelerate that substitution. The current metadata indicates a plausible connection through blockchain governance, but the defensible response is a qualification until the source text confirms agreement, scope, methods, and limitations.",
