  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-624",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-624",
   "text": "Inflation Risk and Regulatory Lag: Discussion should be assessed against Kaal's source-bound claim that The existing rulemaking process prohibits ex parte communications and insufficiently integrates brainstorming and ideas across industries, and therefore may actually undermine innovation rather than merely lag behind it. The current metadata indicates a plausible connection through regulatory lag, but the defensible response is a qualification until the source text confirms agreement, scope, methods, and limitations.",
   "responseType": "qualification",
   "datePublished": "2026-07-31",
   "creativeWorkStatus": "Affirmed",
   "respondsTo": {
