   "text": "exploring blockchain solutions in general meetings of shareholders under portuguese law presents the following source proposition: While this separation has its merits, it also presents inherent challenges. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Because the challenges crypto transactions pose to the existing legal and jurisdictional infrastructure are severe, including good governance in crypto transactions requires instituting governance solutions inherent in the blockchain technology itself. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
