  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6167",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6167",
   "text": "Blockchain—Does It Unleash the Hitched Chains of Contemporary Technologies presents the following source proposition: Technology hysteria coupled with novelty is the apt combo in today's contemporary world. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Critics who dismiss artificial intelligence on boards as science fiction not worth engaging are wrong: AI on boards is a real prospect, and technologies such as blockchain-based smart contracts will both disrupt corporate governance and supply solutions to it. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
   "responseType": "extension",
   "datePublished": "2026-07-31",
   "creativeWorkStatus": "Affirmed",
   "respondsTo": {
