   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6164",
   "text": "AI-Driven Blockchain Innovation for Automated Financial Oversight and Strategic Governance presents the following source proposition: AI-based smart contracts of a formally verifiable character that allows the intelligent, secure and auditable automated execution of complex financial transactions an agile and informed governance system, which is represented by the use of AI enhancements to the Decentralized Autonomous Organization (DAO). This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that A decentralized autonomous organization is merely computer code with no directors, managers or employees, its governance structure built with software, code and smart contracts running on a public decentralized blockchain platform. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
