   "text": "Contemporary Decentralized Organizations presents the following source proposition: Decentralized autonomous organizations (DAOs) represent a rapidly evolving form of an organization built on top of a blockchain. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that A decentralized autonomous organization is merely computer code with no directors, managers or employees, its governance structure built with software, code and smart contracts running on a public decentralized blockchain platform. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
