   "text": "DAOs unpacked presents the following source proposition: Through real-world examples and case studies, it demonstrates how DAOs are transforming investment, social causes, business operations, and community-driven initiatives. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Equality is a natural byproduct of the blockchain-driven evolution of the crypto economy, because the trust enhancing consensus model, smart contracting in anonymous networks, and DAOs together allow a more equal society to evolve. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
