   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6093",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6093",
   "text": "The Governance Product - The Meritocratic DAO: A Service-Based Governance Framework presents the following source proposition: The \"Decentralized Autonomous Organization\" (DAO) was promised as the future of human coordination. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that The public commenting function on the forum lets the CHARITYxDAO internalize information from the edges of the charity ecosystem that would otherwise have no agency in any charitable organization, and that new information further increases the accountability of the DAO. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
