   "text": "Survey of Smart Contract Framework and Its Application presents the following source proposition: The aim is to investigate technological developments and implementation of smart contracts in various domains. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Complex smart contract arrangements involving several parties require a verifiable and unhackable system, which blockchain technology supplies. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
