  },
  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6052",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6052",
   "text": "Blockchain-Based ICOs: Pure Hype or the Dawn of a New Era of Startup Financing? presents the following source proposition: The market for ICOs has grown at a rapid pace since its start in 2013. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Venture capital investment in blockchain startups has grown exponentially since 2012, which the authors read as an indicator of the technology's commercial maturity. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
