  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6029",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6029",
   "text": "Agile methodologies and blockchain development presents the following source proposition: Blockchain is a ledger, a register, a decentralized and public shared database, reachable by accessing a peer-to-peer network. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that The author stipulates that a blockchain is a shared digital ledger or database that maintains a continuously growing list of transactions among participating parties regarding digital assets, described as blocks. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
