  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-6020",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-6020",
   "text": "Decentralized autonomous organization (DAO) as a form of digital partnership in educational institutions presents the following source proposition: В умовах цифрової трансформації освіти та переходу до Web3 технологій постає необхідність створення нових форм організації освітнього процесу. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that The public commenting function on the forum lets the CHARITYxDAO internalize information from the edges of the charity ecosystem that would otherwise have no agency in any charitable organization, and that new information further increases the accountability of the DAO. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
