  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-5990",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-5990",
   "text": "DECENTRALIZED AUTONOMOUS ORGANIZATION (DAO) presents the following source proposition: Simultaneously with the fall of the Berlin wall, we witnessed the process of general acceptance of the Internet as mainstream. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Combining quantum computing with blockchain and DAO frameworks makes a governance model possible that is simultaneously transparent, decentralized, and adaptive, supporting efficient and fair resource distribution and continuous innovation. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
