   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-5931",
   "text": "Cryptoanarchism presents the following source proposition: The aim of this chapter is to situate Decentralized Autonomous Organizations (DAOs) within the philosophical scope of cryptoanarchism. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that A decentralized autonomous organization is merely computer code with no directors, managers or employees, its governance structure built with software, code and smart contracts running on a public decentralized blockchain platform. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
