   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-5920",
   "text": "The Tao of The DAO: Taxing an Entity That Lives on a Blockchain presents the following source proposition: The possibility of using smart contracts to allow an entity to operate totally autonomously on a blockchain platform seems attractive. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Equality is a natural byproduct of the blockchain-driven evolution of the crypto economy, because the trust enhancing consensus model, smart contracting in anonymous networks, and DAOs together allow a more equal society to evolve. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
