   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-5895",
   "text": "IF/THEN Democracy: Exploring the World of Decentralized Autonomous Organizations (DAOs) presents the following source proposition: The future of work is undergoing a significant transformation with the emergence of Decentralized Autonomous Organizations (DAOs), a novel approach to organizational management and decision-making that leverages blockchain technology. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that Decentralized Autonomous Organizations challenge the core belief that governance necessitates agency, attacking organizational design at a fundamental level rather than merely reforming it. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
