   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-5891",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-5891",
   "text": "Decentralized Autonomous Organizations: A Systematic Literature Review and Research Agenda presents the following source proposition: This trend is now culminating with a new phase of innovation called Decentralized Autonomous Organization (“DAO”). This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that The public commenting function on the forum lets the CHARITYxDAO internalize information from the edges of the charity ecosystem that would otherwise have no agency in any charitable organization, and that new information further increases the accountability of the DAO. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
