  {
   "@id": "https://wulfkaal.github.io/positions/2026-07-31-589",
   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-589",
   "text": "Mechanism for dynamic regulation of iNOS expression after UVB‐irradiation should be assessed against Kaal's source-bound claim that The current regulatory framework contains no mechanism that informs rulemakers of beneficial innovative ideas succinctly and in advance, so regulators learn about innovation only after the fact. The current metadata indicates a plausible connection through dynamic regulation, but the defensible response is a qualification until the source text confirms agreement, scope, methods, and limitations.",
