   "text": "A Review on the Security of the Ethereum-Based DeFi Ecosystem presents the following source proposition: Among them, the DeFi ecosystem based on Ethereum-based blockchains attracts the most attention. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that A decentralized autonomous organization is merely computer code with no directors, managers or employees, its governance structure built with software, code and smart contracts running on a public decentralized blockchain platform. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
