   "@type": "Claim",
   "identifier": "kaal:position:2026-07-31-5802",
   "text": "Reducing the Impact of Misalignment: Decentralized Decision-Making Structures presents the following source proposition: Utilizing a comprehensive dataset from Snapshot, a decentralized autonomous organization (DAO) governance platform, we examine the impact of misalignment on participation. This proposition is pertinent to Kaal's source-bound claim that A decentralized autonomous organization is merely computer code with no directors, managers or employees, its governance structure built with software, code and smart contracts running on a public decentralized blockchain platform. The proposed response is an extension: the relationship should remain limited to the retrieved source proposition and the mapped Kaal claim unless fuller source review supports a broader conclusion.",
